      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About three minutes. Seeing one digit at a time makes remembering the code unlikely, not impossible. A digit typed wrong twice becomes the code, so you’ll practice first and check at the end."
